            "title": "Netflix, Occidental Petroleum, Bumble: Trending Tickers",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> and Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Allie Canal</a> track several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/netflix-stock-on-track-to-end-week-down-5-as-elon-musk-calls-for-users-to-cancel-subscriptions-182522911.html\">facing share pressures this week</a> after Tesla (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) CEO Elon Musk called for a boycott over the platform's children's content; HSBC securities and Mizuho analysts both upgrading Occidental Petroleum (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OXY\">OXY</a>) amid Berkshire Hathaway's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-A\">BRK-A</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-B\">BRK-B</a>) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/berkshire-acquire-oxychem-9-7b-133233570.html\">deal to acquire OxyChem for $9.7 billion</a>; and shares of dating app Bumble (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BMBL\">BMBL</a>) receiving a downgrade.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Market Domination host Josh Lipton and Yahoo Finance senior reporter Allie Canal track several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Netflix (NFLX) facing share pressures this week after Tesla (TSLA) CEO Elon Musk called for a boycott over the platform's children's content; HSBC securities and Mizuho analysts both upgrading Occidental Petroleum (OXY) amid Berkshire Hathaway's (BRK-A, BRK-B) deal to acquire OxyChem for $9.7 billion; and shares of dating app Bumble (BMBL) receiving a downgrade. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
